<title>USA: TABLE-Trimble Q2 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Trimble Q2 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six Months	     Q2</p>
<p>					1997	1996    1997     1996</p>
<p> Total revenue		 $129,495 $115,324 $68,944  $58,602</p>
<p> Cost of sales		   61,300   53,052  32,255   27,037</p>
<p> Gross margin		    68,195   62,272  36,689   31,565</p>
<p> Gross margin (%)		 52.7%    54.0%   53.2%    53.9%</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     5,294  ( 3,731)   3,865  ( 2,585)</p>
<p> Net EPS			    0.24   ( 0.17)    0.17   ( 0.12)</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs		  22,484   21,735   22,544   21,791</p>
<p>NOTE: For the quarter, SG&amp;A expenses decreased to 32.2 pct of revenues from 34.3 pct in the preceding quarter and 44.2 pct in the second quarter last year.</p>
<p>Cash position grew over $3 million to $88 million.</p>
<p>Full name is Trimble Navigation Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
